  #line-at(90.024pt, 144.98pt, "We explore the necking, filament thinning, and pinch-off dynamics of ferrofluid droplets within a magnetic field, via a ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 156.38pt, "simple and low-cost experimental method. In our studies, both the Ohnesorge number (")
